    (property "Note" "The MIDI jack's lead plugs in here, on the main board's freed tail corner (issue #37): pin 1 MIDI_TIP, pin 2 MIDI_RING, pin 3 PWR_GND. A JST PH, surface mount and top entry, so no tails stand under the board over the bottom plate. Polarised; reached with the lid off after the cassette drops in, as HDR-SERVICE is" (at 167.64 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
