  (text "MIDI OUT, issue #37 (ADR 0015 amendment 2026-10-04). CA-033 Figure 1's 5 V row: 220R on each of pins 4 and 5,\nfrom U-LVLSHIFT gates B (tip, IO5) and C (ring, IO6), push-pull on the 5 V rail. Symmetric, so TRS Type A or B is\nfirmware's: UART1 TX on the sink line's GPIO, the source line's GPIO held high. midi-out.md has the loop current,\nthe A/B table and the power-on default. J-MIDI-OUT is panel-mounted in the oak bottom with no footprint; its\ntabs are soldered to CBL-MIDI, which plugs into J-MIDI (a JST PH, SMD) on the main board's tail corner." (at 20.32 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a5318728-6f6e-5454-856a-697e39c3993c))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
